      {
        "Id": "e2a7dae446ae41cca0c3e5fadb5ceabd",
        "Title": "IMPORTANT:\nWhat the script actually does is create two walls from the one that already exists and eliminates the previous one.\nThe parameters of comments, level offsets, and assigned level, structural function (instance parameters) are respected and copied to the created walls; with the exception of the Mark parameter.\n\nIf you hide walls with the HH tool, the walls will be cut the same.\nIf you use the Section Box tool, only those that are visible will be cut.\n\nThe stacked walls may not have the desired results.",
        "DescriptionText": null,
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
